        {
          "text": "Mureebe ensi y'Abakaludaaya! Tekiri ihanga. Abaasiria bakagihindura ey'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba. Bakagota Tuuro, baagyombekaho eminaara, baasheenya zaanyaruju zaayo, baagigira amatongo.",
