              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'egyo myaka makumi mushanju MUKAMA aryataayaayira Tuuro, eryagaruka aha bushuubuzi bwayo, eshambane n'amahanga g'abagabe b'omu nsi zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
